{"title":"삼국지 : 읍참마속의 마씨로 살아남기","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bB6EFb/dJMcaa1jYp3/cMK33gauWkhB7Itifux7Qk&filename=th3","synopsis":"읍참마속(泣斬馬謖) \n삼국지를 아는 사람이라면 한 번쯤 들어본 고사성어다.\n\n눈을 떠보니 그 마속과 같은 일족인 미관말직 군후 마막이었다.\n내일이면 계한의 대장군 비의가 암살당한다. \n\n그걸 아는 건 오직 나뿐이다.\n\n마속이 가정에서 날려먹은 나라를― 같은 마씨인 내가 일으켜보이겠다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-10-20","rank":263,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-21","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-20","v":7826,"rc":28,"rs":280,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":8733,"rc":46,"rs":460,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":9613,"rc":50,"rs":500,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":10562,"rc":51,"rs":510,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":11438,"rc":51,"rs":510,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":12081,"rc":52,"rs":520,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":12872,"rc":54,"rs":540,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":13946,"rc":64,"rs":640,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":15057,"rc":87,"rs":861,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-29","v":16003,"rc":92,"rs":911,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-30","v":17041,"rc":93,"rs":921,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-31","v":17621,"rc":94,"rs":931,"cc":2},{"date":"2026-11-01","v":18405,"rc":94,"rs":931,"cc":2},{"date":"2026-11-02","v":19273,"rc":98,"rs":971,"cc":2},{"date":"2026-11-03","v":20247,"rc":106,"rs":1051,"cc":2},{"date":"2026-11-04","v":20850,"rc":106,"rs":1051,"cc":4},{"date":"2026-11-05","v":21642,"rc":110,"rs":1091,"cc":5},{"date":"2026-11-06","v":22525,"rc":111,"rs":1101,"cc":5},{"date":"2026-11-07","v":23130,"rc":169,"rs":1681,"cc":6},{"date":"2026-11-08","v":23725,"rc":206,"rs":2051,"cc":6},{"date":"2026-11-09","v":24185,"rc":206,"rs":2051,"cc":6},{"date":"2026-11-10","v":24786,"rc":239,"rs":2381,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-11-11","v":25147,"rc":251,"rs":2501,"cc":10},{"date":"2026-11-12","v":25625,"rc":256,"rs":2551,"cc":11},{"date":"2026-11-13","v":26254,"rc":259,"r